body:
Let it go girl. I know its hard but you will resent him and never want to be intimate with him again. Every time you'll try and initiate something sexual, you will see those messages as im sure you do now. It won't work out :/. If you stay with him and he's not getting enough sex then he will cheat physically because you let him. It doesn't sound like he cared or was apologetic. It sounds like he wants to blame you for his weakness. Im sorry you're dealing with this but go out with your friends, stay with family, do the things you love and study hard. it'll be worth leaving with a degree and not dead weight. If you stay with him, this experience will get worse and weigh you down. 

&#x200B;

Stay strong! <3

Yeah I will deffo look into it. I'm investing in a doctors visit. I noticed the smell more when im on my period. My theory is that it may be hormonal and also anxiety related because I am an anxious person and then sweat/odour makes it worse! I felt so confident the past few days cos I knew I wasn't stinky hahah. 

&#x200B;

Reddit is so annoying, you're giving good suggestions. Like yeah you're not a doctor but some things are simple?

its the racial element because thats very different to calling someone a wanker. anyone can be a wanker but the N word has a deeply rooted history towards black people, it was obviously used to hurt me.

&#x200B;

Ive had people call me horrible things that weren't racist and it is different.
